{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11110110","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11110110","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1111011001:1":{"text":"……流沙之爪？！","source_cn":"……流沙之爪？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F2B3AC3D369D43B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111011002:1":{"text":"都说了别太冲动。他是我花大价钱收买的线人。","source_cn":"都说了别太冲动。他是我花大价钱收买的线人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEB9B50D77098AAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111011003:1":{"text":"我是拿那些闪闪发亮的金币没办法，才答应和你见一面，没答应要给你消息。","source_cn":"我是拿那些闪闪发亮的金币没办法，才答应和你见一面，没答...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC9AA0A4A1E4A974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111011004:1":{"text":"在这里待得越久，我暴露的风险越高。风险全是我一个人背，凭什么？","source_cn":"在这里待得越久，我暴露的风险越高。风险全是我一个人背，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AC28748760C7FB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111011005:1":{"text":"再加上这些，足够让你面对风险了吗？","source_cn":"再加上这些，足够让你面对风险了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10733237D0A8E1EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111011006:1":{"text":"噢哟，阔绰！这些都够你一年挣的赏金了吧。","source_cn":"噢哟，阔绰！这些都够你一年挣的赏金了吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC70E67D15BCAB8A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111011007:1":{"text":"少跟他废话。你让这家伙来这里做什么？不是让我揍来解气的，就让他快滚开。","source_cn":"少跟他废话。你让这家伙来这里做什么？不是让我揍来解气的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF59D94747E2B224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111011008:1":{"text":"冷静，你还想不想知道族人的消息？","source_cn":"冷静，你还想不想知道族人的消息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6180AA2BCD720382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111011009:1":{"text":"……啐。","source_cn":"……啐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF02C094B48CED86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111011010:1":{"text":"那就按照我的规矩，一个问题，一袋金币。","source_cn":"那就按照我的规矩，一个问题，一袋金币。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E58F612CBE94344","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111011011:1":{"text":"事先声明，要我直接说出大本营所在地或者弗兰克的计划，没门。那家伙对手下和对俘虏一样残暴，我还想活命。","source_cn":"事先声明，要我直接说出大本营所在地或者弗兰克的计划，没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F7C267D36883D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111011012:1":{"text":"你们可以问，我不会回答。钱照付。不同意的话就当我今天没来过。","source_cn":"你们可以问，我不会回答。钱照付。不同意的话就当我今天没来过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2787865F8DB158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1111011012":{"text":"你们可以问，我不会回答。钱照付。不同意的话就当我今天没来过。","source_cn":"你们可以问，我不会回答。钱照付。不同意的话就当我今天没来过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2787865F8DB158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111011013:1":{"text":"没办法……遇见萨忒娜小姑娘之前，没有其他方式可以知道流沙之爪的动向。钱之前就付过，人也找来了，不能白花。","source_cn":"没办法……遇见萨忒娜小姑娘之前，没有其他方式可以知道流...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x670321A5602F8EAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111011014:1":{"text":"拿着你的钱。第一个问题，弗兰克的近况？我不需要知道他在哪里。","source_cn":"拿着你的钱。第一个问题，弗兰克的近况？我不需要知道他在哪里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC5CABE565A59C26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111011015:1":{"text":"哼，听说宝藏传闻后，他和一些人类勾结上，学会了制定复杂的劫掠计划。拜他所赐，我们这些手下每天都有活干，再也没有之前的清闲日子了。","source_cn":"哼，听说宝藏传闻后，他和一些人类勾结上，学会了制定复杂...","status":"matched","ha